      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree. Even outside of the chatbox criticism, the menu being unbalanced vertically like this on desktop is very disorienting. It feels unnatural having to look that high up on my monitor for the top when the bottom of it doesn't reach as low in the opposite direction.\n\nIt should definitely just be centered vertically anyway.",
