      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Nevermind, this doesn't seem easily fixable.\n\nIt was just pointed out to me that the menu can't be centered because the empty space at the bottom of the screen is there for tooltips, which I had forgotten about.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
